{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the initial state of a pack. The state of a pack becomes known by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the time the shared "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object sends the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" about the pack. For inactive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"packs, you must explicitly request a progress update using the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack\/requestProgress","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An invalid pack always has a state of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateInvalid","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown"},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"symbolKind":"case","title":"MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","role":"symbol","externalID":"c:@E@MLNOfflinePackState@MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","fragments":[{"text":"MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration Case"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"It is unknown whether the pack is inactive, active, or complete."}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackstate\/mlnofflinepackstateunknown"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage/removePack:withCompletionHandler:":{"title":"removePack:withCompletionHandler:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/removepack:withcompletionhandler:","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/removePack:withCompletionHandler:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"removePack:withCompletionHandler:"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Unregisters the given offline pack and allows resources that are no longer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"required by any remaining packs to be potentially freed.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification":{"title":"MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackprogresschangednotification","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Posted by the shared "},{"identifie